<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVA FOREIGN TRADE GAP GREW TO $73.1 IN JAN-FEB.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVA FOREIGN TRADE GAP GREW TO $73.1 IN JAN-FEB.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's foreign trade</p>
<p>deficit widened to $73.1 million in the first two months of</p>
<p>1997 from $41.2 million in the same period in 1996, an official</p>
<p>from the State Statistics Department said.</p>
<p> MOLDOVAN FOREIGN TRADE   Jan-Feb'97   Jan'97    Jan-Feb'96</p>
<p> Exports ($ mln)		104.1	  47.1	101.2</p>
<p> Imports			  177.2	  77.0	142.4</p>
<p> Balance			  -73.1	 -29.9	-41.2</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
